                        "entry_id": "3e4444bb-3005-316a-927b-74660fb481df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A ring which is contained in a larger ring, such that the multiplication and addition on the former are a restriction of those on the latter. When rings are required to have a multiplicative identity (as is standard in most branches of algebra), the subring must also have the same multiplicative identity as the larger ring."
